WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.571
Finally, the interview team.

00:00:02.571 --> 00:00:07.250
One screen shows who's eligible, who's booked, and what's happening today.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:11.978
Here's everyone who's ready but hasn't booked yet.

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.440
Select them, send a reminder, done.

00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:19.265
Last-minute emergency changes land here for review.

00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:21.962
Approve one, and no attempt is used.

00:00:21.962 --> 00:00:23.835
Reject it, and it counts.

00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:30.648
If a student says they were marked absent unfairly, the team sees both sides of the story before deciding.

00:00:31.661 --> 00:00:37.691
And if cheating comes to light after a pass, the badge can be taken back in one step, with the reason on record.
